# =============================================
# NOTES FOR TESTING
# =============================================

# 1. Start the backend server: npm run dev (in backend directory)
# 2. Ensure MySQL is running with seeded data
# 3. Install REST Client extension in VS Code
# 4. Run tests in order for dependent operations
# 5. Some tests require authentication - run login first
# 6. Check server logs for detailed error information
# 7. Use browser DevTools Network tab for frontend integration
# 8. Monitor database state during booking flow tests

